        "sectionId": "faq-band",
        "values": {
          "eyebrow": "Questions dealers ask",
          "heading": "Frequently asked questions.",
          "faqs": [
            {
              "q": "How is Buzznerd marketing different from a normal ad agency?",
              "a": "Buzznerd builds campaigns around your live inventory instead of a generic keyword list. Ads, remarketing, and landing pages reflect what's actually on your lot, and performance is measured all the way to the sale."
            },
            {
              "q": "Which marketing channels does Buzznerd manage?",
              "a": "Buzznerd manages Google Ads, Meta remarketing, email campaigns, social promotions, and inventory-connected landing pages — all tied to your live inventory and product data."
            },
            {
              "q": "Can Buzznerd tie marketing spend to actual sales?",
              "a": "Yes. Channel-to-sale attribution connects each lead and sale back to the channel that drove it, so you can see which campaigns produce real deals rather than just clicks."
            },
            {
              "q": "Do I need a Buzznerd website to use the marketing service?",
              "a": "Marketing works best alongside a Buzznerd website and the AI platform because campaigns run on live inventory data, but we'll discuss options for your current setup during a demo."
            },
            {
              "q": "How do campaigns stay current with my inventory?",
              "a": "Campaigns are connected to live inventory, parts, and product data, so as units sell or arrive, the ads and landing pages reflect what's actually available."
            }
          ]
        },
